    termsHAllow: "Permitted uses",
    termsPAllow: "This tool is for lawful purposes such as software development, QA, form validation, UI / UX examples and screenshots, internationalisation testing and teaching demonstrations. It may also serve as a temporary placeholder in interface demos where entering real details would be inappropriate.",
    termsHNature: "Nature of the data",
    termsPNature: "The generated data is randomly synthesised content. It <b>does not represent real people</b> and is not guaranteed to correspond to a real dwelling or a deliverable address. Countries, administrative divisions and cities use public place names; streets, house numbers, names, phone numbers, emails, companies and accounts are randomly generated values. Emails use mainstream provider domain shapes but are never checked for existence; payment cards reproduce only the numbering structure published by card networks and deliberately fail Luhn validation.",
